=== Known subtype-association check ===
top_mean = highest-MEAN subtype; max_line = subtype of the single highest-expressing line;
exp_rank = rank (by mean, 1=highest) of the EXPECTED subtype. Model selection cares that the
expected subtype CONTAINS high expressers (top_line_in_expected), not only that it tops the mean.
